            These picks are based on manufacturer data sheets and bag labels (joint width range, minimum joint depth, cure and rain windows), color availability, typical retail pricing, and recurring patterns in owner feedback. We did not run our own lab trials. Where a maker does not publish a spec, we leave it out rather than guess.
          </p>

